---
description: Classification and rewrite stay in the skin. Domain only sees Posture.
globs: crates/**/*.rs,docs/VOICE.md
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/VOICE.md` before changing classification or rewrite.

- Domain never calls Jev, OpenRouter, or any HTTP model. It takes `Posture`.
- Prompts live in `crates/sdk/src/prompts.rs`. Edit that file when the wording should change.
- `JudgeHub` weighs words (Jev, OpenRouter `openrouter/free`, local chat, or the word gate).
- `RefineHub` rewrites on the first submit. The person edits, then `VoicePass::Publish`.
- Talk to OpenRouter / Ollama with `reqwest`. Do not add Rig unless the user asks.
- Fail to the word gate if a remote judge is down. Do not block every post on an outage.
- Classification runs on the words they publish, not the first draft.
